# What never belongs in a build context — A64-027.0.
#
# Two reasons, and the second is the one that bites: a large context is slow
# to send to the daemon, and a context carrying `.env.local` is a context
# that can put a developer's secrets into an image layer.

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

tests/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.import_linter_cache/
.grimp_cache/

var/
*.log

.git/
.gitignore
.idea/
.DS_Store
